{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53168","headline":"送最澄上人还日本国 · 全济时","name":"送最澄上人还日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家与扶桑近，烟波望不穷。\n来求贝叶偈，远过海龙宫。\n流水随归处，征帆远向东。\n相思渺无畔，应使梦魂通。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"全济时","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}